{"version":1,"content":"<p>【AI 生成用 ✅】如果閣下經常要用 AI 生成人物圖像，但發現姿勢難以精準控制，怎麼辦？</p><p>近日，日本有開發者公開名為「AI Beauty 姿勢資料庫」（AI Beauty &quot;Posing&quot; Database）的免費素材庫，共收錄 1,439 張各類姿勢圖片。</p><p>該資料庫全面開放個人與商業用途，並允許使用者進行修改與二次創作，旨在大幅降低創作者在生成 AI 人物時調整動作的門檻。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:22:28.769586+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:59:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:18:10.926503+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T09:18:47.300649+00:00","content_hash":"f10d0166a07e63d9dff896f954cf1b309e87441a8f91745c2ff060963cb1d83f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}